'''PZ Translator''' is a web tool which you can provide to any users to have them translate your mods from a webpage, and automatically creating a fork, translation branch and pull request to your mod's [[wikipedia:GitHub|GitHub]] repository. The tool is provided by the [[PZ Modding Community]].

